---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'November 9, 2026';
const h2 = 'text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display';
const link = 'text-[var(--color-charcoal)] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[var(--color-timber)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-charcoal)]';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How PCM Homes collects, uses and protects the information you share through our website and contact form.">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-12 bg-[var(--color-cream)]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-medium mb-4 text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
        Privacy <span class="italic">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-stone)]">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-24 bg-[var(--color-cream)]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 prose-pcm">
      <p>
        PCM Homes builds custom homes, cottages and renovations in Ontario. This page explains what information
        we collect through pcm.homes, why we collect it, who helps us handle it, and the choices you have.
        If you have a question about it, email <a class={link} href="mailto:info.pcmhomes@gmail.com">info.pcmhomes@gmail.com</a>
        or call <a class={link} href="tel:+19057161939">(905) 716-1939</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>What we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>When you fill out our contact form</strong>, we collect what you type in:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name, email address and phone number</li>
        <li>Your project location, the service you're interested in, budget range, timeline and planning stage</li>
        <li>Your message</li>
        <li>Whether you ticked the box to receive project photos and building tips, along with the wording of that box</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>When you browse the site</strong>, our analytics tools record general visit information, such as pages
        viewed, how you arrived, your device and browser type, and your approximate region. We use this to see which
        pages help people and which need work.
      </p>
      <p>We don't ask for payment details, ID numbers or other sensitive information on this website.</p>

      <h2 class={h2}>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your inquiry and talk with you about your project</li>
        <li>To prepare estimates and plan work you ask us about</li>
        <li>To send you occasional project photos and building tips, only if you ticked the box to receive them</li>
        <li>To improve the website</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don't sell or rent your information to anyone.</p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Email from us</h2>
      <p>
        If you send us an inquiry, we'll email you about that inquiry. We'll only add you to marketing emails if you
        tick the opt-in box on the form. Every marketing email will include a way to unsubscribe, and you can also
        ask us to stop at any time by replying or emailing
        <a class={link} href="mailto:info.pcmhomes@gmail.com">info.pcmhomes@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Services that help us run the site</h2>
      <p>We use a few trusted providers. They handle your information only to provide their service to us.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Formspree</strong> receives contact form submissions and emails them to us. It stores a copy of each submission.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the website and provides basic visit statistics through Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies.</li>
        <li><strong>Google</strong> provides Google Analytics, which uses cookies to measure how visitors use the site. You can opt out with the <a class={link} href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a> or by blocking cookies in your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Gmail</strong> is where we receive and answer email.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Some of these providers store data outside Canada, including in the United States. Information stored there
        may be subject to the laws of that country.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep inquiry details for as long as we need them to respond, to carry out any project we take on, and to
        meet our legal and tax record-keeping obligations. If you opted in to marketing emails, we keep your email
        address for that purpose until you unsubscribe.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Show you the personal information we hold about you</li>
        <li>Correct anything that's wrong</li>
        <li>Stop sending you marketing emails</li>
        <li>Delete your information, unless we need to keep it for a project or legal reason</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Email <a class={link} href="mailto:info.pcmhomes@gmail.com">info.pcmhomes@gmail.com</a> and we'll respond
        within 30 days. If you're not satisfied with our answer, you can contact the
        <a class={link} href="https://www.priv.gc.ca/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Keeping it safe</h2>
      <p>
        The site runs over a secure HTTPS connection, and we limit access to inquiry details to the people at PCM Homes
        who need them to help you. No method of storing or sending information online is perfectly secure, but we take
        reasonable steps to protect what you share with us.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change how we handle information, we'll update this page and the date at the top.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
